abstract: >-
  Computational certificate accompanying the paper "Divisible formal
  weight enumerators: Chebyshev determinants, extremal bounds, and zeros
  of Duursma zeta polynomials." The software verifies the finite algebraic
  inequalities used in the computer-assisted part of Theorem C.
keywords:
